abstract: >-
  EpiAid is Module 3 of the EpiCalc Suite: an offline-first clinical
  decision support tool for missionary, NGO, and community health worker
  field medical use. Features include a weight-based dosage calculator
  for WHO Essential Medicines, MUAC nutrition screening with Z-score
  calculation, WHO IMCI-protocol diagnostic checklists (dehydration,
  pneumonia, malaria, newborn danger signs), clinical phrase cards, and
  offline patient logging via IndexedDB. The interface is fully localized
  in English, Korean, French, and Swahili. The app is optimized for 2G/3G
  environments and runs entirely offline after first install as a
  Progressive Web App.
